@SYSTEM_TITLE
; DRAWLINESTR is the bar Emuera bakes once at start-up from `DRAWLINE文字`
; (`GameProc/Process.cs:117` -> `getStBar`), so it is the same string DRAWLINE
; prints. With the default 760 px window it is 84 half-width cells wide:
; DrawableWidth = 760 - max(2, 18 / 6) = 757, one half-width cell is 18 / 2 = 9
; px, and 757 / 9 = 84.
PRINTFORML {STRLENS(DRAWLINESTR)}
PRINTFORML %DRAWLINESTR%
; It is a string, so string methods see it like any other.
PRINTFORML {STRFIND(DRAWLINESTR, "--")}
